.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK MILESTONE RELEASE ADD"
.SH NAME
hamstik milestone release add \- Add a release version to the milestone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik milestone release add [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a release version to the milestone
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ID
Milestone id (UUID)
.TP
.I RELEASE_ID
Release version id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --reason
Why the release was added
.TP
.B --force
Bypass revision conflict protection (If-Match: *)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
